          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "It’s game time! This immersive card puts basketball fans right in the middle of the action with legendary gold medalist and MVP Diana Taurasi! Diana acts as coach, mentor, and guide through drills, teamwork exercises, affirmations, and breathwork.  Feel the dribble's heartbeat-like rhythm, the trust of a pass, the squeak of sneakers changing direction, and the swish of a perfect shot!\n \nDiana invites listeners to slow down, breathe, and move between moments of active play, and calm, meditative listening to build focus, teamwork, and self-belief on and off the court.\n\nThis card is filled with the authentic sounds of the game and mantras that have featured throughout Diana’s incredible career. Whether you’re preparing for game day, cooling down after practice, or just dreaming about basketball, listeners will find a coach, a mentor, and a soundtrack for the game, and for life!\n\nDiscover: 2 tracks. Available until 1st December. Full Card: 6 tracks. For ages 6-12.",
